description:
Nursery Rhymes have always created passive Learning for Children. While they read they are learning new words as well as words that rhymes while having fun. Nursery Rhymes stimulate the brain and aids interest in learning.


Thank you for being here with us!
@Children-12j

This Story teaches children about overcoming their fear. Fear is just one step before you reach your goal. Always believe in yourself and you will be able to achieve anything. It is ok to be fearful just don’t stay there too long. The moment you step out of fear you begin to propel yourself to do more than what you’re comfortable doing.

Thank you for reading with us, we appreciate you for being here🥰❤️
@Children-12j

This bedtime Lullaby is awesome for children. It creates a calming ambiance which will soothe and relax the Brian. Children will feel loved and safe. This lullaby is my favorite.



Thank you for being here with us. 🥰

@Children-12j

Nursery rhymes has always been a treat for children, it teaches children how to rhyme and sing along. These nursery rhymes helps children to be cognizant of words that rhyme and can easily build rhymes of their own. Rhyming words are a fun way to build vocabulary.


Thank your for sings and rhyming with us, we appreciate you🥰❤️

@Children-12j
